      <node id="mtg-security-2026-09-22@1.0#weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/password-reset-workload/1" label="mtg-security-2026-09-22@1.0#weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/password-reset-workload/1">
        <viz:color r="127" g="127" b="127" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="5" value="chunk" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026 | Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026 &gt; Password reset workload&#10;Joseph counted 37 helpdesk password resets from 2026-06-01, when the new password policy took effect, through 2026-09-21. The count is completed reset requests, not failed sign-in attempts or unique members of staff. It includes repeat requests from the same person where each needed a separate reset.&#10;&#10;The team agreed not to treat the number alone as evidence that the longer password requirement is causing difficulty. Joseph will add the ordinary request reasons to the next workload summary. That should help distinguish forgotten passwords from first-use assistance without collecting any password values." />
          <attvalue for="16" value="{&quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-22&quot;, &quot;department&quot;: &quot;IT&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: &quot;mtg-security-2026-09-22&quot;, &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;meeting&quot;, &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;Security&quot;, &quot;section_path&quot;: &quot;weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/password-reset-workload&quot;, &quot;status&quot;: &quot;current&quot;, &quot;supersedes&quot;: null, &quot;technique_ids&quot;: [], &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026&quot;}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="mtg-security-2026-09-22@1.0#weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/meeting-room-pc-and-the-office-move/1" label="mtg-security-2026-09-22@1.0#weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/meeting-room-pc-and-the-office-move/1">
        <viz:color r="127" g="127" b="127" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="5" value="chunk" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026 | Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026 &gt; Meeting-room PC and the office move&#10;MR-PC-01 is due to move with the UK meeting room during the weekend of 2026-09-26. Ruby asked that Facilities confirm the new room is ready before IT Support moves the machine. There should be a short check afterwards that the display, keyboard and normal sign-in work.&#10;&#10;The move changes the location, not the approved users or their account permissions. IT Support should update the location after the physical move is confirmed. Nobody should guess the completion time from the planned schedule." />
          <attvalue for="16" value="{&quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-22&quot;, &quot;department&quot;: &quot;IT&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: &quot;mtg-security-2026-09-22&quot;, &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;meeting&quot;, &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;Security&quot;, &quot;section_path&quot;: &quot;weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/meeting-room-pc-and-the-office-move&quot;, &quot;status&quot;: &quot;current&quot;, &quot;supersedes&quot;: null, &quot;technique_ids&quot;: [], &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026&quot;}" />
        </attvalues>
      </node>
      <node id="mtg-security-2026-09-22@1.0#weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/shared-device-register/1" label="mtg-security-2026-09-22@1.0#weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/shared-device-register/1">
        <viz:color r="127" g="127" b="127" />
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="5" value="chunk" />
          <attvalue for="15" value="Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026 | Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026 &gt; Shared device register&#10;The register is due for its twice-yearly review in December 2026. The office move is also a reason to check location details sooner. Ruby will ask the relevant teams to confirm the users of both shared machines during review preparation. The meeting did not approve a revised user list." />
          <attvalue for="16" value="{&quot;date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-22&quot;, &quot;department&quot;: &quot;IT&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: &quot;mtg-security-2026-09-22&quot;, &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;meeting&quot;, &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;Security&quot;, &quot;section_path&quot;: &quot;weekly-security-meeting-22-september-2026/shared-device-register&quot;, &quot;status&quot;: &quot;current&quot;, &quot;supersedes&quot;: null, &quot;technique_ids&quot;: [], &quot;title&quot;: &quot;Weekly Security Meeting, 22 September 2026&quot;}" />
